    {
      "text": "younger son of Lehi1 born in wilderness, 1 Ne. 18:7. is grieved because of mother’s afflictions, 1 Ne. 18:19. words of Lehi1 to Joseph, 2 Ne. 3. thou wast born in wilderness of mine affliction, 2 Ne. 3:1. may the Lord bless thee forever, for thy seed shall not be destroyed, 2 Ne. 3:3, 23. is admonished to hearken unto words of Nephi1, 2 Ne. 3:25. follows Nephi1 from land, 2 Ne. 5:5–6. is consecrated priest, 2 Ne. 5:26 (Jacob 1:18). is just and holy man, Alma 3:6.",
